    "regime_notes": "The 10-day continuation effect is positive in 2027, 2028, and 2031 YTD, but negative in 2026 and 2030; the 20-day decay reverses sign. Results are statistically strong on the paper IC/ICIR gates but should be used cautiously given the 15-instrument cross-section and regime dependence.",
